{"ID":"20240118151114-mugfk6f","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240118151114-mugfk6f","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151114-mugfk6f\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240118151114-k3m2mqk\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133840-qwloalu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240122133840-qwloalu\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:88,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:88\u0026#125;","title":"213秦椒","type":"doc","updated":"20240201165420"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240118151114-k3m2mqk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240118151114-k3m2mqk","updated":"20240122133817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【本经原文】味辛，温，有毒。治风邪气，温中，除寒痹，坚齿，长发，明目。久服轻身，好颜色，耐老，增年，通神。生川谷。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133821-8jbgvcu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133821-8jbgvcu"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【产地】椒之一种，产我国陕西甘肃，今处处有之。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133823-is3pb1r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133823-is3pb1r"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【性味】味辛，性温，有毒。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133825-n0jwla9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133825-n0jwla9"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【主治】秦椒主温中去寒，除风邪气，治风湿痹，喉痹吐逆，疝瘕老血。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133826-rdzy3ly","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133826-rdzy3ly"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【别录】疗喉痹，吐逆，疝瘕，去老血，产后余疾，腹痛，出汗，利五脏。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133828-20tpoad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133828-20tpoad"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【甄权】治恶风遍身四肢，疗痹，口齿肿胀摇动，女人月闭不通，产后恶血痢，多年痢，疗腹中冷痛，生毛发，灭瘢。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133831-2dc2zhk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133831-2dc2zhk"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【用量】普通五分至钱半。 "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133832-u028wpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133832-u028wpa"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"【禁忌】用椒红，去目，恶栝楼防葵，畏雌黄，闭口者有毒勿用。参看蜀椒条。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240122133818-oukez4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133818-oukez4k"}},{"ID":"20240122133833-th2tqfr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133833-th2tqfr"}},{"ID":"20240122133833-u2sqi7j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133833-u2sqi7j","updated":"20240201165355"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"213这叫秦椒，你用这个椒也可以，用这个椒。213秦芄（椒），山椒的椒。那这个味道是辛辣的，能够这个，也是滋补的药，味辛为温。它除了温中散寒以外，这个秦椒呢，我们能够治疗背痛、关节骨骨髓、补筋骨、生毛发，皮肤上有斑。过去一些那个皮肤上你开完刀以后，这个伤口怎么搞的，肿起来很大，像螃蟹脚一样很大，那这种用秦皮，内服都可以加秦皮。皮类的药，我们用根苗花果，用它的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"皮有桑白皮、地骨皮啊、生姜皮啊、陈皮啊、五加皮啊，反正皮类的药，大部分我们可以入皮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，我们有五皮饮，五种不同中药的皮。那这种秦皮呢对皮肤上的斑，不好看的，都可以有帮助。当我们外敷的也有，待会我们讲到外敷的这个斑。"}]},{"ID":"20240122133840-qwloalu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240122133840-qwloalu","updated":"20240201165420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补充：秦椒呢，就是开刀以后伤口长得很大，皮肤有红红的一条一条的鲜红色粉红色的，我们用秦椒。那是内服，有外用的，但不是秦椒也不是秦皮，用僵蚕，我们外面用僵蚕，僵蚕收疤的时候，收得疤皮肤颜色很漂亮。那秦椒秦皮呢我们可以做洗眼的药水用。"}]}]}